*  Examples of data cards for ALPHA on UNIX machines :
*  a * in column 1 means : this card is a comment
* example to read a file from cartridge using an EDIR :
* the example below works on all machines , the GIME is ignored outside CERNVM
* ( in all cases you should ask SCANBOOK to generate these cards for you )
FILI ' julia-test.epio | EPIO'
* to get the Energy Flow package results :
*ENFL
* to obtain jets with the Energy Flow package results :
*EFLJ
* to obtain the interaction point from the QFNDIP package :
*QFND
* both cards above (EFLJ,QFND) are mandatory if you use QFNDIP or QIPBTAG !
*
* example of other useful cards :
*FILO 'rwaleph.epio | EPIO'
NEVT 10
DEBU  0
ENDQ
